<title>CANADA: Newbridge says UB price around US$100 mln.</title>
<headline>Newbridge says UB price around US$100 mln.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newbridge Networks Corp expects to pay about US$100 million for the previously announced acquisition of UB Networks Corp from Tandem Computers Inc, Newbridge president Peter Charbonneau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Charbonneau told a media teleconference the final price of the UB Networks acquisition depends on final accounting before the deal was to close in late January. But he said US$100 million was &quot;in the right order of magnitude.&quot;</p>
<p>Charbonneau also said the acquisition of the networking company that was announced earlier on Thursday would be a cash transaction.</p>
<p>((Russell Blinch (416) 941-8103, or e-mail: russell.blinch@reuters.com))</p>
